A reference link's text survives its own frame

```
a [t</#}>][r] b

[r]: /u
.
<p>a <a href="/u">t&lt;/#}&gt;</a> b</p>
```

```
a [t[x][r2]][r] b

[r]: /u

[r2]: /v
.
<p>a <a href="/u">tx</a> b</p>
```

```
a [t[x][r2]](/u) b

[r2]: /v
.
<p>a <a href="/u">tx</a> b</p>
```

```
a [t![z][r2]][r] b

[r]: /u

[r2]: /i.png
.
<p>a <a href="/u">t<img src="/i.png" alt="z"></a> b</p>
```
